{
  "id": "E369",
  "title": "Fun at the Shopping Mall",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-10-18",
  "synopsis": "Why does Lili want to bring Ben along to the shopping mall?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50369/2381ed5ef01122c9bc79a170d11bfe2d178898e9.mp3?1571051803",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们去商场玩吧\n\n本：丽丽，这个周末我们去哪里玩？公园怎么样？\n丽丽：公园太热了，还有很多蚊子。我们去商场吧！\n本：去商场？可是我没有什么想买的东西。\n丽丽：除了买东西，在商场还可以做很多别的事情啊。\n本：是吗？比如？\n丽丽：太多了！商场里有很多饭店，还有KTV和电影院。这个周末学校附近那个商场还有一个艺术展呢！\n本：听起来很有意思，那周末我们一起去商场吧。",
    "traditional": "我們去商場玩吧\n\n本：麗麗，這個週末我們去哪裏玩？公園怎麼樣？\n麗麗：公園太熱了，還有很多蚊子。我們去商場吧！\n本：去商場？可是我沒有什麼想買的東西。\n麗麗：除了買東西，在商場還可以做很多別的事情啊。\n本：是嗎？比如？\n麗麗：太多了！商場裡有很多飯店，還有KTV和電影院。這個週末學校附近那個商場還有一個藝術展呢！\n本：聽起來很有意思，那週末我們一起去商場吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let’s go have fun at the shopping mall"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，这个周末我们去哪里玩？公园怎么样？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，這個週末我們去哪裏玩？公園怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì zhè ge zhōu mò wǒ men qù nǎ lǐ wán gōng yuán zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, where are we going for fun this weekend? How about a park?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：公园太热了，还有很多蚊子。我们去商场吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：公園太熱了，還有很多蚊子。我們去商場吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì gōng yuán tài rè le hái yǒu hěn duō wén zi wǒ men qù shāng chǎng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Parks are too hot and there are a lot of mosquitoes. Let’s go to the shopping mall!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：去商场？可是我没有什么想买的东西。",
      "traditional": "本：去商場？可是我沒有什麼想買的東西。",
      "pinyin": "běn qù shāng chǎng kě shì wǒ méi yǒu shén me xiǎng mǎi de dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Go to the shopping mall? But I don’t have anything I want to buy."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：除了买东西，在商场还可以做很多别的事情啊。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：除了買東西，在商場還可以做很多別的事情啊。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì chú le mǎi dōng xi zài shāng chǎng hái kě yǐ zuò hěn duō bié de shì qing a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: There are a lot of different things you can do at the shopping mall other than shopping."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：是吗？比如？",
      "traditional": "本：是嗎？比如？",
      "pinyin": "běn shì ma bǐ rú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Really? For example?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：太多了！商场里有很多饭店，还有KTV和电影院。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：太多了！商場裡有很多飯店，還有KTV和電影院。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tài duō le shāng chǎng lǐ yǒu hěn duō fàn diàn hái yǒu K T V hé diàn yǐng yuàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "这个周末学校附近那个商场还有一个艺术展呢！",
      "traditional": "這個週末學校附近那個商場還有一個藝術展呢！",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge zhōu mò xué xiào fù jìn nà ge shāng chǎng hái yǒu yí ge yì shù zhǎn ne",
      "english": "Lili: So many things! There are a lot of restaurants in the mall, as well as karaoke and movie theaters."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This weekend that shopping mall near our school even has an art exhibition!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "本：听起来很有意思，那周末我们一起去商场吧。",
      "traditional": "本：聽起來很有意思，那週末我們一起去商場吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn tīng qi lai hěn yǒu yì si nà zhōu mò wǒ men yì qǐ qù shāng chǎng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: It sounds very interesting. Then let’s go to the shopping mall together this weekend."
    }
  ],
