    "sentence_translations": [
      "Let’s go have fun at the shopping mall",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, where are we going for fun this weekend? How about a park?",
      "",
      "Lili: Parks are too hot and there are a lot of mosquitoes. Let’s go to the shopping mall!",
      "",
      "Ben: Go to the shopping mall? But I don’t have anything I want to buy.",
      "",
      "Lili: There are a lot of different things you can do at the shopping mall other than shopping.",
      "",
      "Ben: Really? For example?",
      "",
      "Lili: So many things! There are a lot of restaurants in the mall, as well as karaoke and movie theaters.",
      "This weekend that shopping mall near our school even has an art exhibition!",
      "",
      "Ben: It sounds very interesting. Then let’s go to the shopping mall together this weekend.",
      ""
    ]
